└── README.md                     # This file
```

## Customization

- Modify `src/app/app.component.html` to update the main application layout
- Add new components using Angular CLI: `ng generate component component-name`
- Create new services using Angular CLI: `ng generate service service-name`
- Update routes in `src/app/app-routing.module.ts`
- Configure API endpoints to connect with your backend service